WEBVTT

00:15:59.829 --> 00:16:02.251
They said, "We want freedom;
we want democracy.

00:16:02.275 --> 00:16:03.942
We are Muslim believers,

00:16:03.966 --> 00:16:07.864
but we want to be living
as free people in free societies."

00:16:08.253 --> 00:16:10.612
Of course, this is a long road.

00:16:10.636 --> 00:16:13.915
Democracy is not an overnight
achievement; it's a process.

00:16:13.939 --> 00:16:17.905
But this is a promising era
in the Muslim world.

00:16:17.929 --> 00:16:21.546
And I believe that the Islamic modernism
which began in the 19th century,

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:23.780
but which had a setback
in the 20th century

00:16:23.804 --> 00:16:26.363
because of the political
troubles of the Muslim world,

00:16:26.387 --> 00:16:27.567
is having a rebirth.

00:16:27.965 --> 00:16:32.627
And I think the takeaway message
from that would be that Islam,